{
    "title": "FM Radio : AM, FM, Radio Tuner",
    "description": "FM Radio offers you the best of the Radio Tuner, Internet Radio, AM & FM Radio Stations Online in one app.\r\n\r\nIf you want to listen to the best FM Radio, AM Radio, Live Radio and internet radio stations, then Tuner Radio is the app that you should tune in. The best part is through Radio FM app, you can listen to 65,000+ <b>Live Radio</b> Stations globally anytime and anywhere without paying anything. \r\n\r\n<b>FM Radio</b>, Radio Tuner allows you to listen to local radio and enjoy a variety of genres like gospel, songs, music, talks, news, comedy, classical, rock, pop, instrumental, hip-hop and so more\r\n\r\n<b>Why choose our FM Radio app:</b>\r\n\r\n* \ud83d\udcfb Radio FM allow listeners to navigate live local radio stations by country, genre, language and network.\r\n\r\n* \u2764\ufe0f Add to Favorites: You can add your favorite Radio AM, Radio Tuner, Live Radio, Local Radio and FM Radio Stations to our simple radio app. \r\n\r\n*\ud83d\udccdNear Me: You can easily find your am fm radio and <b>local radio station</b>.\r\n\r\n* \u25b6\ufe0f Background play: One can Listen to Radio FM, <b>AM Radio</b>, Tuner Radio and Local Radio anytime, anywhere even while cooking, driving or doing anything else in the background.\r\n\r\n* \u23f0 Alarm Clock: Set your alarm and start your day with your favourite am radio, fm radio, tuner radio and local radio stations.\r\n\r\n* \u23f1\ufe0fSleep Timer: Set the sleep timer and go to sleep and our <b>Radio Tuner</b> app will stop the FM radio when it ends.\r\n\r\n* You can report any <b>simple radio</b> station with a single click if any of the radio isn't playing on our internet radio App.\r\n\r\n* Share this Radio FM app with your friends family and with your loved ones\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d \r\nWith the search tab users can find any of the <b>AM FM radio</b>, Tuner Radio, FM Radio, live fm stations and local radio by country, Language, genre and network \r\n\r\n* Recently Played: This feature displays a list of the FM, AM radio stations  you've recently listened to, making it convenient to return to stations you enjoy.\r\n\r\nAlso, if you can\u2019t find any FM Radio, Tuner Radio, Live Radio and Local Radio Stations or if you have any suggestions/complaints, then get in touch with us at <b>thenonstopradio@gmail.com</b> and we will surely help you out. \r\n\r\nFor All Broadcasters:  \r\n\r\nIf you are a broadcaster and you want to add Radio FM, AM Radio, Live Radio and Local Radio stations to our radio directory then contact us via email at <b>thenonstopradio@gmail.com</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Website: https://thenonstopradio.com/</b>\r\n\r\nSocial media -\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/thenonstopradio\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/thenonstopradio\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/non_stopradio",
